Error [jet.DispatchHoleOutsideTable]: `_` stands for an arm's candidate only in the header of an `if` table
  --> Tests/UI/e0947_dispatch_hole_outside_table.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     y: _ + x
    |        ^
 Why: In `if header { candidate -> body }` each candidate takes the place of the header's `_`; nowhere else does `_` have a value
 Fix: Write the value here, or move the test into an `if` header followed by `{` and its arms
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0947
